<img class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" data-alt="A monochrome cement tile with a sophisticated interlocking link pattern in charcoal grey and light silver. The lighting captures the flat matte texture and precise lines of the modern design. Clean, high-contrast aesthetic suitable for a premium corporate portfolio." src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuConP-ZWpTYmTR7H1s1R5v9gPKWFiITLxCjy7trj8X8zdrcU8myVSdJ3YpN5sc6CLS91dizgDv-XtHo4FNIvyyIpW-ECAWsqPI-9TybYcqetrOGswGaEJ99NNBLXGJW7I10_l8ESvAxyogqPh5O73RecZKOarojQw7ZKok_LQnTdaB9qgXFcahfsHP3U2Q7FNfMqJvjfp4n04Ksb3oC3tVswF95Y6aNr_vSYJ6MervC5VvwjnwxxAhN6tZBNGBpQhoRQlvPwdPc8EI">
</div>
