</div>
</div>
<p class="text-body-md text-[14px] leading-relaxed opacity-90 mb-8 italic">
                            "Every tile for the Azure project is being hand-pressed using your custom mineral pigments. Quality checks for the geometric star pattern are currently underway."
                        </p>
<div class="flex gap-4">
